# Public Vite build-time configuration. Never put secrets, credentials, or JWTs here.
# Copy to .env.local (ignored). Do not commit an actual deployment API origin.
# Empty uses same-origin /api; only the Vite dev server supplies the local proxy.
# For direct API access, use an origin such as https://api.example.invalid (no /api).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
